> Our Community Support Scheme has now donated over £150,000 to[ deserving causes] throughout Nottingham[shire], Der[byshire] and surrounding areas since the Scheme was established in 2008. The milestone was reached when the Scheme�[�]s trustees agreed to distribute another £20,000 to 40 groups in 2017 looking for funding to help bring their plans to life.
